Spec: Shared widgets

Purpose:
  Widgets several features share.

Owns:
  ./app_bottom_sheet.dart
  ./app_snack_bar.dart
  ./pill_button.dart
  ./sheet_input_field.dart
  ./stacked_dialog_actions.dart
  ./status_bar_style.dart
  /test/core/widgets

Must:
  @showAppScrollableSheet opens forms and filters with a drag handle at `90` % height, closable by dragging
    from scrolled content.
  @showAppBottomSheet opens short pickers and forms that hug their content, capped at `90` % and closable by dragging.
  @appSnackBar shows a leading brand icon and a close icon and auto-dismisses even with an action.
  @ThemeStatusBar sets status-bar icons from the app theme; @DarkChromeStatusBar forces light icons.

Must not:
  Build a bare `SnackBar`.
